Add user-facing support panel UI (prompt 2 of 3)

New components:
- SupportPanel.tsx: slide-out panel with three views (home, chat, article)
- SupportHelpButton.tsx: floating ? button with unread badge

Features:
- Searchable help articles grouped by category
- AI-powered chat with typing indicator and auto-scroll
- Escalation to human support (manual or AI-triggered)
- Past conversation list with status badges
- Article detail view with feedback buttons
- Responsive: full-screen on mobile, 420px panel on desktop

Integration:
- Floating ? button at bottom-left (opposite Aria button)
- Settings dropdown Help and Support opens panel instead of /app/help
- All CSS in design-system.css using existing design tokens
